WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.749
Morphy played queen to b8, with check.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.684
The knight captured the queen,
clearing the d-file.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.299
Rook to d8 was checkmate.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.189
The bishop protects d8
and covers the king's escape on e7.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:26.093
A queen was lost, but the coordinated pieces won.
Look beyond material.
